[25]="70060FAE\n1\tReúnete con los Boffin fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en la calle Aguamiel\tDinodas y los otros Boffin han acordado reunirse contigo fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en Nobotella, en la calle Aguamiel.\n2\tHabla con Dinodas Boffin en la calle Aguamiel\tDinodas está fuera de la nueva casa de Angélica en la calle Aguamiel, muy satisfecho consigo mismo.\n3\tHabla con Prisca Boffin en la calle Aguamiel\tPrisca Boffin y muchos de sus hijos se han reunido en la calle Aguamiel para dar la bienvenida a Angélica a su nueva casa.\n4\tHabla con Bingo Boffin en la calle Aguamiel\tBingo Boffin está en la calle Aguamiel con su prima Prisca y algunos de sus hijos.\n5\tHabla con Angélica Boffin fuera de su nueva casa\tAngélica Boffin está encantada de verte a ti y a muchos de sus familiares que han venido a Nobotella para darle la bienvenida a su nueva casa.\n6\tHabla con Dinodas fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel\tDinodas está solo fuera del nº 9 de la calle Aguamiel.\n",
[26]="70048C7E\n1\tFind an altar\tOrc altars can be found in northern Agarnaith. You should find an Orc altar.\n2\tLie downon an altar\tOrc altars can be found in northern Agarnaith. You should try lying down on an altar.\n3\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be called with the goblin-caller. You should talk to Viznak.\n",
[27]="70065DAD\n1\tShoo badgers around the river Erui away (total: 12)\tCrithon has asked you to drive away badgers around the river Erui south-west of Imloth Melui.\n2\tTalk to Crithon\tThe badger problem has been addressed. You should report your progress to Crithon. Crithon is in Imloth Melui.\n3\tTalk to Arlach\tCrithon has asked you to deliver your report to Arlach. Arlach can be found in Arnach.\n",
[28]="70017579\n1\tDerrota a Bidroi\tEl orco Bidroi puede encontrarse en el nivel inferior de la Segunda Sala, donde cayó presa de su desconcierto. La Segunda Sala se encuentra al norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra y al este de Zelem-Melek. Celofa espera con ansias compartir nuevas habilidades como saqueador avanzado, pero primero te ha encomendado una tarea sencilla: derrotar al orco Bidroi.\n2\tRegresa junto a Celofa\tCelofa puede encontrarse en el Refugio Sombrío, en los tramos septentrionales de las Fundaciones de Piedra, en Moria. Ahora que has derrotado a Bidroi, deberías regresar junto a Celofa para que pueda comenzar a enseñarte sus habilidades avanzadas de saqueador.\n",
[29]="70053392\n1\tDefeat half-orcs and ruffians at Sharkey's Slough (total: 20)\tHalf-orcs and ruffians can be found at Sharkey's Slough in the Gladden Fields. Half-orcs and ruffians loyal to Sharkey have begun to use dredging machines Saruman long ago abandoned on the Gladden Fields to begin a new search.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many half-orcs and ruffians at Sharkey's Slough.\n",
[30]="70044D52\n1\tThe Stone Theatre can be found in the northern section of the First Circle. Polla Stoutley has asked you to shoo away workers from the stage in the Stone Theatre so that her band can practice without distraction.\t\n2\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. You have shooed away the workers in the Stone Theatre and should now return to Polla.\n3\tSearch for Góthrik in the Wheel and Cask tavern\tThe Wheel and Cask can be found to the north-east in the First Circle of Minas Tirith. Polla has asked you to seek out her band's stagehand, Góthrik, who hasn't been seen since they arrived in Minas Tirith.\n4\tTalk to Góthrik\tGóthrik can be found inside the Wheel and Cask tavern in the First Circle of Minas Tirith. You have found Góthrik in the Wheel and Cask, and should now ask him to return to aid the Cloudyheads in setting up their new performance.\n5\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. Góthrik has decided to quit working with the Cloudyheads and has asked you to inform Polla of his resignation.\n6\tTalk to Gord Dunley\030Habla con Robbo Moliespalda\030Talk to Daenar\030Talk to Fróki\030Talk to Hollur\tThe other members of the Cloudyheads can be found near the entrance of the Stone Theatre. Polla has asked you to introduce yourself to the band before taking over Góthrik's duties.\n7\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. You have introduced yourself to the Cloudyheads and should now return to Polla.\n",
[31]="7001AD22\n1\tDestruye estandartes de orcos (total: 6)\tLos estandartes de guerra de los orcos se pueden encontrar en Krul Lugu, debajo de la Guardia de Iavassúl. Iavassúl te ha pedido que destruyas los estandartes de guerra de los orcos para desmoralizar al enemigo.\n2\tHabla con Iavassúl en la Guardia de Iavassúl\tIavassúl se encuentra en la Guardia de Iavassúl, sobre Krul Lugu. Vuelve con Iavassúl e infórmale de que los estandartes orcos han sido destruidos.\n",
[32]="7006832A\n1\tDefeat spiders in Maj Khibi (total: 8)\tHûrlub the Bellower seems like a gentle creature. He has asked you to defeat spiders in Maj Khibi.\n2\tTalk to Hûrlub the Bellower\tThe spiders should be less likely to bother Hûrlub now. You should speak to Hûrlub in Phadâl Bimai. Phadâl Bimai can be found at the northern coast of Jeb Khâtel.\n",
})
